      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/tallassee_tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1819 Treaty of Calhoun ceded Tallassee to the United States, ending Cherokee control.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        11
