      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/tallassee_tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the 1950s, TVA’s Chilhowee Dam flooded the historic Cherokee site, creating Chilhowee Reservoir.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
